{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":1,"content":"Implemented the CSV CLI fixes in `/workspace/in/csvtool`:\n\n- Uses Python’s `csv` reader/writer, preserving quoted commas.\n- Supports repeated `--where` with AND semantics.\n- Keeps selected headers for empty results.\n- Supports `--sort -field` descending and `--sort field` ascending.\n- Sorts numeric-looking values numerically.\n- Validates missing fields for `--where`, `--select`, and `--sort`.\n- Reports malformed `--where` expressions with non-zero exit status.\n- Added `tests/test_cli_regression.py`.\n\nVerification:\n\n- Required CLI scenarios passed via smoke tests.\n- Existing and new test assertions passed when invoked directly.\n- `python3 -m compileall csvtool tests` passed.\n- The requested `python -m pytest tests` could not run because `python` is unavailable. `python3 -m pytest tests` also could not run because pytest is not installed in the environment."}}
